{"speciesId":622,"names":{"fr":"Gringolem","es":"Golett","en":"Golett","ja":"ゴビット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se meut grâce à l’énergie stockée dans son corps. Personne ne sait d’où vient cette énergie mystérieuse."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On pense que ce Pokémon est le produit de la technologie d’une civilisation ancienne."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon are thought to have been created by the science of an ancient and mysterious civilization."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It’s been active for thousands of years."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It’s been active for thousands of years."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se meut grâce à l’énergie stockée dans son corps. Personne ne sait d’où vient cette énergie mystérieuse."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se mueve gracias a la energía que quema dentro de su cuerpo, pero el origen de esta energía es incierto."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体内で 燃える エネルギーに よって 活動しているが どんな エネルギーなのかは 不明である。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon fait de terre glaise, produit de la technologie d’une civilisation antique, vit depuis des millénaires."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon creado a partir del barro gracias a la ciencia de antaño. Lleva activo miles de años."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It’s been active for thousands of years."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"古代の 科学力に よって 粘土から つくられた ポケモン。 数千年 動き続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il se meut grâce à l’énergie stockée dans son corps. Personne ne sait d’où vient cette énergie mystérieuse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se mueve gracias a la energía que quema dentro de su cuerpo, pero el origen de esta energía es incierto."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体内で 燃える エネルギーに よって 活動しているが どんな エネルギーなのかは 不明である。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon fait de terre glaise, produit de la technologie d’une civilisation antique, vit depuis des millénaires."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon creado a partir del barro gracias a la ciencia de antaño. Lleva activo miles de años."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It’s been active for thousands of years."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"古代の 科学力に よって 粘土から つくられた ポケモン。 数千年 動き続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Une mystérieuse énergie l’alimente depuis l’Antiquité, mais, qui sait ? Cette énergie n’est peut-être pas éternelle..."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se mueve gracias a una misteriosa energía, pero, habiendo estado activo desde la antigüedad, dicha energía podría agotarse tarde o temprano."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its movements are powered by a mysterious energy. It has continued to move since ancient times, so its power may soon run out."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"謎の エネルギーに よって 活動。 古代から 動き続けているので そろそろ パワーが 尽きるとも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les anciens, désirant avoir un serviteur, l’auraient façonné avec de l’argile. En revanche, on ignore toujours d’où provient son énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se dice que fue creado antiguamente a partir de arcilla para usarlo como sirviente, pero se desconoce cuál es su fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although ancient people apparently built it by working with clay, the source of its energy is unclear."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"古代人が しもべに するため 粘土を こねて こしらえたらしいが エネルギー源は 不明だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon très ancien a été façonné avec de l’argile. On ne sait pourquoi certains spécimens n’ont de cesse d’aligner de grosses pierres."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Un antiguo Pokémon creado a partir del barro. Se desconoce el motivo por el que algunos ejemplares colocan rocas grandes en hileras."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"They were sculpted from clay in ancient times. No one knows why, but some of them are driven to continually line up boulders."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"粘土から 生み出された 古代の ポケモン。 なぜか 大岩を 並べ続ける ものも いる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon fait d’argile continue de respecter les ordres que son maître lui a donnés il y a quelques millénaires."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Fue creado a partir del barro para emplearlo como sirviente. Todavía acata las órdenes que le dio su amo hace milenios."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon was created from clay. It received orders from its master many thousands of years ago, and it still follows those orders to this day."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"粘土から つくられた ポケモン。 何千年も 前の 主の 命令を 今も 守っている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":622,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",8],[25,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[11,"level-up",21],[14,"level-up",21],[15,"level-up",21],[16,"level-up",21],[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",32],[20,"machine",0],[25,"